            </note>
            <note corresp="#d107-f4" n="4" xml:id="d107-f4-content">
                <p>Delga 360, November 6, recounted Lodge’s discussion with Aiken and Boland regarding the 15th General
                    Assembly presidency. (Department of State, Central Files, 320/11–659) Delga 377, November 9, reported that the Irish
                    Cabinet had agreed to Boland’s candidacy. (<hi rendition="#italic">ibid</hi>.,
                    320/11–959)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
